### 1. Turn the follow-up on: SMS a day before, call back two days after a missed date
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/payment-promises/settings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "reminderEnabled": true,
  "reminderDaysBefore": 1,
  "reminderTemplate": "Hurmatli mijoz, {date} gacha {amount} so'm to'lashga va'da bergansiz. Rahmat!",
  "graceDays": 2,
  "recallOnBroken": true,
  "paymentGoalKey": "payment"
}

### 2. The company's settings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payment-promises/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 3. Open promises due this month
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payment-promises/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{ "page": 0, "size": 20, "status": "OPEN", "promisedFrom": "2026-10-01", "promisedTo": "2026-10-31" }

### 4. Kept-promise rate for October
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payment-promises/stats?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 5. A payment reported by the company's system (keeps the open promise of that number)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{ "goalKey": "payment", "phone": "+998901234567", "occurredAt": "2026-10-09T12:00:00Z", "valueUzs": 500000, "dedupeKey": "pay-1001" }

### 6. Mark promise 1 paid by hand
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payment-promises/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{ "status": "KEPT" }
